OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786681089
OL,3,CMore than 60% of adults have not
OL,4,Cbought sunscreen so far this year `
OL,5,Csurvey
OL,7,FMore than 60% of adults have not
OL,8,Fbought sunscreen so far this year
OL,9,Fdespite the run of heatwaves, a survey
OL,10,Fsuggests.
OL,12,FJust 56% of adults in England,
OL,13,FScotland and Wales bought sunscreen in
OL,14,Fthe last two years, the poll by
OL,15,FWorldpanel by Numerator for Nivea Sun
OL,16,Ffound.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
