FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786681089
OL,3,CMore than 60% of adults have not
OL,4,Cbought sunscreen so far this year `
OL,5,Csurvey
OL,7,FThe survey of 30,000 people across
OL,8,FEngland, Scotland and Wales showed
OL,9,F8.5% more people bought sunscreen this
OL,10,Fyear compared to the previous year,
OL,11,Fthe equivalent of 1.6 million people
OL,12,Fand the highest in five years.
OL,14,FNearly 30% bought SPF50, more than
OL,15,Fdouble the proportion buying any other
OL,16,FSPF level.
OL,18,FHowever, despite the increase in
OL,19,Fsales, Cancer Research UK warned that
OL,20,Ftoo few adults are buying and using
OL,21,Fsunscreen.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
