OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786681089
OL,3,CMore than 60% of adults have not
OL,4,Cbought sunscreen so far this year `
OL,5,Csurvey
OL,7,FIt warned that using sunscreen from
OL,8,Fprevious years can reduce its
OL,9,Feffectiveness.
OL,11,FIt comes as the charity revealed that
OL,12,Fthe annual number of new melanoma skin
OL,13,Fcancer cases in the UK passed 20,000
OL,14,Ffor the first time in 2022, and is
OL,15,Fprojected to reach over 26,000 a year
OL,16,Fby 2040.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
