CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786681089
OL,3,CMore than 60% of adults have not
OL,4,Cbought sunscreen so far this year `
OL,5,Csurvey
OL,7,FUV radiation from the sun, rather than
OL,8,Fheat, causes sunburn and skin cancer
OL,9,Fand the sun can be strong enough to
OL,10,Fburn from mid-March to mid-October in
OL,11,Fthe UK, whether there is a heatwave or
OL,12,Fnot, the charity said.
OL,14,FConsumers can look for the open-lid
OL,15,Fsymbol featuring the letter M and a
OL,16,Fnumber, which shows how many months
OL,17,Fthe sunscreen will last once open.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
