FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786681089
OL,3,CMore than 60% of adults have not
OL,4,Cbought sunscreen so far this year `
OL,5,Csurvey
OL,7,FCancer Research UK also advises that
OL,8,Fpeople seek shade in the heat,
OL,9,Fespecially between 11am and 3pm in the
OL,10,FUK, cover up with with clothes, a wide-
OL,11,Fbrimmed hat and UV protection
OL,12,Fsunglasses, and apply sunscreen with
OL,13,Fat least SPF 30 and four or five stars.
OL,15,FSunscreen should be reapplied
OL,16,Fregularly and generously, especially
OL,17,Fafter swimming, sweating, or towelling.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
